            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuzakuthi ngalolosuku abaseleyo koIsrayeli, abasilileyo endlini kaJakobe, kabasayikuthembela kuye abatshayileyo; kodwa bazathembela eNkosini, oNgcwele kaIsrayeli ngeqiniso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaseleyo bazakubuya, abaseleyo bakaJakobe babuyele kuNkulunkulu olamandla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba lanxa abantu bakho, Israyeli, bengangetshebetshebe lolwandle, kuzakubuya phakathi kwabo abaseleyo kuphela; ukuchitheka kumisiwe okubafaneleyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.9.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Roma 9:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba iNkosi uNkulunkulu wamabandla izaletha ukubhujiswa okumisiweyo phakathi kwawo wonke umhlaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke iNkosi uNkulunkulu wamabandla ithi: Lina bantu bami, elakhe eZiyone, lingabesabi abaseAsiriya lapho belitshaya ngenduku, beliphakamisela intonga yabo njengamaGibithe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba ngesikhatshana nje ukuthukuthela kwami kuzaphela, lolaka lwami luphendulelwe ekubachitheni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi izakubatshaya ngomchilo, njengasekutshayeni kwayo iMidiyani ngasedwaleni laseOrebi; izaphakamisela iAsiriya intonga yayo njengokwenza kwayo eGibithe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuzakuthi ngalolosuku umthwalo ususwe emahlombe enu, lejogwe laphulwe entanyeni yenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
